                  "id": "faq-what-is-cybersecurity",
                  "icon": "FaShieldAlt",
                  "question": "Why does my small or midsize business need cybersecurity?",
                  "answer": "Most automated attacks target growing companies because they assume smaller businesses have fewer defenses. Practical cybersecurity prevents financial loss, protects your customer trust, and keeps your operations online without surprises."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-why-cybersecurity-important",
                  "icon": "FaCog",
                  "question": "Will setting up security slow down our daily work?",
                  "answer": "Not at all. Our defense tools run silently in the background. Your team can login quickly, access files smoothly, and work normally without frustrating interruptions or confusing procedures."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-common-cyber-threats",
                  "icon": "FaServer",
                  "question": "What are the biggest online threats businesses face today?",
                  "answer": "Phishing emails that trick staff into giving away passwords, ransomware that locks files, and outdated software vulnerabilities. We put simple safeguards in place to stop all three before they enter your network."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-protect-business",
                  "icon": "FaUsers",
                  "question": "How quickly can you secure our company?",
                  "answer": "Basic coverage can be deployed in just 24 to 48 hours. We start with immediate risk checks, install essential file backups and login verification, and then build your complete defense strategy step by step."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-ongoing-monitoring",
                  "icon": "FaCloud",
                  "question": "Do you monitor our systems over weekends and holidays?",
                  "answer": "Yes, 365 days a year. Hackers often attack when offices are closed, so our automated threat detection and on-duty engineers monitor your systems around the clock, non-stop."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-industries-served",
                  "icon": "FaFileAlt",
                  "question": "What types of industries do you protect?",
                  "answer": "We support retail stores, healthcare clinics, financial services, tech startups, law firms, and manufacturing businesses. Any company that relies on computers and the internet can benefit from our protection."
                }
              ]
